 a combat move, potentially suppressing the correct non-combat sound later in the turn. This is precisely the bug that the fix commit corrects by splitting the condition back into two independent if-statements with their own sound clips and flags.\n\nNo other candidate in the 191-commit set shows this specific merged/buggy pattern being introduced (candidates 189 and 191 only touch adjacent lines such as id.getName() vs id, inheriting the buggy state that candidate_190 introduced).\n"
